  "prefLabel": "Puc 802.08 Hand digging",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 802.08 “Hand digging” means any excavation involving non-mechanized tools or equipment and includes, but is not limited to, digging with shovels, picks, probing bars, and manual post hole diggers.\n\nSource. #7350, eff 8-23-00; ss by #9226, INTERIM, eff 8-16-08; ss and moved by #9318, eff 11-8-08 (from Puc 802.07); ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
